add_to_text.plain, line 2, while running: Make "todos" a list to add items to it, or join the text with { }.

    add "walk the dog" to todos
    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Try one of these:
    set todos to a list of "buy milk"
    add "walk the dog" to todos
  or
    set todos to "{todos}walk the dog"
Why: "todos" is the text "buy milk", and "add" only adds numbers or puts items on a list.
